2011.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: Jan phoned this morning and asked to speak to you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: But I'd already told her that I was inspecting the building work. She &lt;b&gt;should have known I wouldn't be in my office&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: I'm putting on a lot of weight. I think I need to start doing some exercise.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: Well, maybe you [should take up golf].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/2012.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: I'm putting on a lot of weight. I think I need to start doing some exercise.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: Well, maybe you &lt;b&gt;should take up golf&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>At the trial, the judge recommended that Paul Thornton, 35, [should serve at least 12 years in prison].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/2013.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>At the trial, the judge recommended that Paul Thornton, 35, &lt;b&gt;should serve at least 12 years in prison&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>We've lost 10 of our last 12 matches. But we've been unlucky. I really feel we [should have won at least 8 of those].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/2014.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>We've lost 10 of our last 12 matches. But we've been unlucky. I really feel we &lt;b&gt;should have won at least 8 of those&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>My parents said that I should go to university, but I just wanted to get a job and earn some money. But now I know that I [should have followed their advice].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/2015.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>My parents said that I should go to university, but I just wanted to get a job and earn some money. But now I know that I &lt;b&gt;should have followed their advice&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>The woods that we're going to walk in are likely to be very muddy, so you [should wear your wellington boots].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/2016.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>The woods that we're going to walk in are likely to be very muddy, so you &lt;b&gt;should wear your wellington boots&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>High levels of pollution have been found in the waters of Sandy Bay. A warning has been issued that holidaymakers [should avoid swimming in the area].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/2017.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>High levels of pollution have been found in the waters of Sandy Bay. A warning has been issued that holidaymakers &lt;b&gt;should avoid swimming in the area&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: Mona and Karim came to dinner last night. I was expecting them at eight o'clock but they didn't arrive until nine – and they didn't let me know.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: That was very thoughtless of them. I really think they [should have texted to say they would be late].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/2018.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: Mona and Karim came to dinner last night. I was expecting them at eight o'clock but they didn't arrive until nine – and they didn't let me know.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: That was very thoughtless of them. I really think they &lt;b&gt;should have texted to say they would be late&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>I did four of the five questions in the exam, but afterwards I learnt that I [should have answered only three of them].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/2019.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>I did four of the five questions in the exam, but afterwards I learnt that I &lt;b&gt;should have answered only three of them&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>It's not very far from here to Stratford. If you're driving, it [should take less than an hour].</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/20110.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>It's not very far from here to Stratford. If you're driving, it &lt;b&gt;should take less than an hour&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question></question_xml><enableAudioOnChecked>false</enableAudioOnChecked><enableAudioOnClosed>true</enableAudioOnClosed><correctFeedback_str /><incorrectFeedback_str /><attemptsAllowed>1</attemptsAllowed></mcq_xml></params_xml><alignment>none</alignment><alignPercent>100</alignPercent><custom_style_name /><sharedTokenBankId /><is_sequential>False</is_sequential><is_compulsory>False</is_compulsory><states><state id="queued" visible="True" enabled="False" /><state id="in_progress" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="complete" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="checked" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="closed" visible="True" enabled="True" /></states></params></object><object linkID="background_image"><params><imageURL>learning_objects/assets/agu_filler.png</imageURL><horizontalAlign>center</horizontalAlign><verticalAlign>bottom</verticalAlign><custom_style_name /><sharedTokenBankId /><is_sequential>False</is_sequential><is_compulsory>False</is_compulsory><states><state id="queued" visible="True" enabled="False" /><state id="in_progress" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="complete" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="checked" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="closed" visible="True" enabled="False" /></states></params></object></objects></page>